sequenceDiagram
  participant SIG as SIGTERM / exit request
  participant LB as Router / readiness
  participant W as Worker
  participant Q as Queue / WorkItem owner
  participant T as Transcript / effect journal
  participant O as Observer exporter
  SIG->>LB: mark not-ready / stop new work
  SIG->>W: enter draining
  W->>Q: finish or release owned work explicitly
  W->>T: flush critical state / recovery marker
  W->>O: bounded telemetry flush
  alt all work complete
    W-->>SIG: drained
  else grace deadline reached
    W-->>T: leave indeterminate recovery evidence
    W-->>SIG: force exit
  end
